Wrapping up In this tutorial, we have seen how to create different types of validation rules and apply them to different situations. These rules included NotRule, AndRule, OrRule, IncludedRule, ExcludedRule and AtLestOneExistsRule.
These rules are valuable in cases where we have to compile highly complex logical expressions, as they help to simplify our code, and thus, avoid unintentional errors.

